# Quest goals: One-time (単発).
# Every *.cson in this directory is merged into one table; see README.md.

###
# One-time (単発)
#
# The game marks these api_type 4 with api_label_type 1. They never repeat, so
# they deliberately carry no `type`: any reset type would delete the record at
# the next period boundary and throw away the progress of a quest that is still
# open. `resetInterval` still works without a `type` if a counter has to reset.
###
313: # 秋季大演習 秋の一日中に「演習」で8回以上「勝利」をおさめ、艦隊のさらなる練度に努めよ！
  # 季節任務。ゲーム側は単発(api_type 4 / label 1)なので type は付けず、
  # 同日中に8回という条件だけ resetInterval で扱う
  resetInterval: 1
  "practice_win":
    description: "演習勝利"
    required: 8
    init: 0
1052: #改装多目的搭載母艦「北上改三」、出撃ッ！ 2026-09-10 実装
